		<item>
			<title>Madonna is in New York City</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/40-madonna-is-in-new-york-city.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/40-madonna-is-in-new-york-city.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Madonna</strong>'s stay in <strong>London</strong> lasted just the time to take a connecting flight from <strong>London</strong>'s <strong>Heathrow Airport</strong> to <strong>JFK Airport</strong> in <strong>New York City</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>Her Madgesty</strong> was with her children <strong>Lourdes</strong>, <strong>Rocco</strong>, <strong>David</strong>, and <strong>Mercy</strong>.</p>
<p>In the <a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/29-madonna-reveals-the-release-dates-for-her-new-single-and-her-upcoming-album.html" target="_self" title="Interview with Swedish SVT Television">now-famous interview</a> with <strong>Swedish SVT Television</strong>, where <strong>Madonna</strong> revealed the release dates for her new single and upcoming album, she also confessed that "when I go back to New York, till the end of the year I'll be in the recording studio."</p>
<p>But <strong>Madonna</strong> has to take a break soon for the premiere of <strong>W.E.</strong> at the <strong>Toronto International Film Festival 2011</strong>, where her red carpet is planned for <strong>September 12</strong>.</p>
<p>Another already planned break is on <strong>November 12</strong> for the <strong>Smirnoff Nightlife Exchange Project</strong>, a cool social media marketing strategy to discover a dancer for <strong>Madonna's new tour</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><img src="http://drownedmadonna.com/img/2011/madonna-we-pendant.jpg" border="0" alt="Madonna wearing a W.E. pendant" width="790" height="395" style="border: 0;" /></p>
<p> </p>
<p>Travelling from <strong>Venice</strong> to <strong>London</strong> and finally to <strong>New York</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> was spotted wearing a stylish <strong>W.E. pendant</strong> especially designed for her.</p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>U.S.A.</li><ul></div>]]></description>
